@startuml Diagrama_de_Actividades_Anadir_Costo

title Activity Diagram - Add Another Cost

|#LightBlue|User|
|#LightGreen|System|

|User|
start
:Press the button\nto add another cost;
:Register the name;
:Register the values\nfor the range (2025-2030);
:Press save button;

|System|
:Receive the new concept and its values;

if (Is the concept\nname empty?) then (yes)
  :Show error\n"The concept name is required";
  |User|
  :Fix the concept name;
  stop
else (no)
endif

if (Does a concept with the\nsame name already exist\nin that category?) then (yes)
  :Show error\n"A concept with that name already exists";
  |User|
  :Enter a different name;
  stop
else (no)
endif

if (Are all entered\nvalues numeric?) then (no)
  :Show error\n"Values must be numeric";
  |User|
  :Fix the entered values;
  stop
else (yes)
endif

if (Is any value negative\nand the category\ndoes not allow it?) then (yes)
  :Show error\n"The value cannot be negative";
  |User|
  :Fix the value;
  stop
else (no)
endif

if (Are values missing for\nany year in the range?) then (yes)
  :Show warning\n"Complete the values for all years"\nand keep the row in edit mode;
  stop
else (no)
endif

:Insert the new row\ninto the selected category;
:Recalculate the financial ratios;

|User|
:View the updated table with\nthe new cost and the\nrecalculated financial ratios;
stop

@enduml
